            dealer's statutory obligations are between the dealer and that consumer.
        </p>

        <h2 class="h5 mt-4">32. Closing your account</h2>
        <p>
            You may close your account at any time by emailing
            <a href="mailto:drobi840@gmail.com">drobi840@gmail.com</a>.
        </p>
        <p>What happens then, so there are no surprises:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>your personal details are cleared and your account is anonymised;</li>
            <li>every photograph you uploaded is deleted, including listing photos, your
                profile picture and any dealership logo or banner;</li>
            <li><strong>completed sales remain</strong> in the sold history, without
                photographs and without identifying you, because a sale that happened is a
                record the other party has an interest in;</li>
            <li>reviews you wrote about other sellers remain.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="h5 mt-4">33. Disputes and governing law</h2>
        <p>
            These Terms are governed by the law of the Republic of Albania, and the courts of
